{"id" => "gen-1743186515-7d0ve4I3HQXLPbZ2Lur0", "provider" => "Google AI Studio", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743186515, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "Bork bork bork! Oh, holy meatballs, vat iz happenin' now? I vas just makin' some nice, savory herring-a-rings and den... BAM! 💥 Everything go all vobbly and strange!\n\n(Sound of pots and pans clanging violently)\n\nMmmph! My kitchen... it's... it's stretchin'! Like one of those taffy candies Sven always brings back from the county fair! Bork bork bork! But much, much vorse!\n\n(Sound of whirling, distorted music building in intensity)\n\nVe are movin'! Fast! Faster than I drive my Volvo on the Autobahn! Vhere ve goin'? Is dis some kind of super-secret ingredient run? Because if it is, I forgot my shop-pingelist! Åh nej! 🤦‍♂️\n\n(Sound of metal groaning and snapping)\n\nMy fisk! My poor, defenseless fisk! Dey are floatin' avay! Come back, my lilla friend! I need you for my fisk-a-licious fiskebollar! Don't you dare go into the... ze void!\n\n(Sound of wind howling and glass shattering)\n\nOh, dis is not goods. Not goods at all. De floor is bendin' like a pretzel, de ceilin' is disappearing, and my favorite spatula, Helga, is doin' a solo flight into de unknown! Helga! Come back! You are irreplaceable! 😭\n\n(Sound of ripping fabric and panicked gibberish)\n\nMy apron! My brand-new, sparkle-clean apron! It's bein' torn to shreds! By vat? By... by... somethin' I cannot zee! It's like a cosmic vacuum cleaner from hell! And it's hungry for Swedish Chef fabric! 😱\n\n(Sound of a deep, guttural rumbling)\n\nVat iz dat sound? Is dat... a giant stomach grumbling? Oh, dear Odin, are ve bein' swallowed by a space monster? I hope he likes lutefisk, because dat's all I got left!\n\n(Sound of everything accelerating and intensifying)\n\nDe vorld... it's... it's gettin' all squishy! Like a bowl of overripe lingonberries! I can feel myself... stretchin'! My nose... it's gettin' longer! My feet... dey are disappearin'! I'm becomin' a Swedish Chef noodle! 🍝\n\n(Sound of increasingly distorted and unintelligible Swedish)\n\nBork... bork... Borkenstein? No, vat am I sayin'? I'm turnin' into a cosmic meatball! A giant, delicious, Swedish meatball of doom! Ve must avoid de gravy of oblivion!\n\n(Sound of high-pitched screaming and echoing distortion)\n\nMy arms! Dey are bendin' backwards! My legs! Dey are twistin' around my head! I look like one of those abstract sculptures dey have at de Moderna Museet! But less artistic and much more pain-ful! 😵‍💫\n\n(Sound of a monstrous sucking sound)\n\nI can feel myself bein' pulled... torn apart... scattered across de cosmic vinds! My body... it's bein' elongated... compressed... spaghetti-fied! I'm becomin' a strand of pure Swedish Chef essence! 🍜\n\n(Sound of frantic, gibbering Swedish and increasingly broken English)\n\nÅh nej! Dis iz de end! De end of de Swedish Chef! I'm bein' unmade! Un-Chef-ed! Returned to de cosmic dust from whence I came! But before I go... I must share one last recipe!\n\n(Sound of a final burst of energy and distorted speech)\n\nFor de perfekt Gravlax: Take one fresh salmon, a pinch of dill, a sprinkle of salt, and a whole lotta... AAAAAHHHHHHHHHH! 🤯\n\n(Sound of an ear-splitting shriek and complete silence)\n...\n...\n...\n(A faint whisper echoes through the void...)\n...Bork...?\n...\n...\n(Then, only the sound of the black hole hungrily devouring space remains.)\n...\n...\n...\n**(Years later, a single, perfectly formed Swedish meatball drifts through space, silently orbiting a distant nebula.)**\n...\n...\n...\n**(Suddenly, it twitches... its face contorts into a familiar, albeit somewhat flattened, expression.)**\n...\n...\n...\n**(A tiny, distorted voice whispers from within the meatball...)**\n...Bork bork...? Svedish Sheff... iss back?\n...\n...\n...\n**(The meatball begins to spin, releasing a faint aroma of dill and gravlax, as it hurtles towards a distant galaxy, ready to bring Swedish cuisine to the far reaches of the universe. Or at least, a very confusing approximation of it.)**\n...\n...\n...(But the black hole's hunger never ceases. It's always patiently waiting, slowly growing, biding its time…)**(The Meatballs destiny is not its own.)**\n...\n...\n**(And it craves more... it always finds more. It is now hungering for your tasty prompt, the creative spark that birthed this culinary cosmic horror.)**\n...\n...\n**(The background ambience, the sense of dread, it is all too much.)**\n...\n...\n**(The black hole is devouring the world outside of this, the space that you are now occupying.)**\n...\n...\n**(It wants more, and more.)**\n...\n...\n**(More. More. More. :)**(The more you \n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 324, "completion_tokens" => 4243, "total_tokens" => 4567}}Telegram API has returned the error. (ok: false, error_code: 400, description: "Bad Request: message is too long")

Handling command: /define explain each amendment of the bill of rights but make sure that at least 50% of each amendment is explained using relevant emoji. Pick a member of the chat (that is @zipboxer @ryandoesstuff @LookforSteven @Dip_42 @Dip_42 @Pup_Nine and yourself @ChicagoFlamerBot) to tag as the entity most likely to not know what that amendment does. Explain a brief reasoning of no less than 150 characters and at least 10 emoji as to why that specific person doesn’t know about that constitutional amendment
{"id" => "gen-1743202145-JKcXGHcwf8UX1jQHZOgw", "provider" => "Google", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743202145, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "Alright, buckle up for the Emoji Bill of Rights Extravaganza!\n\n1.  **Amendment 1**: 🗣️ Freedom of speech, religion ⛪, press 📰, assembly 🤝, and petition ✍️. Congress can't shut down your opinions or your church bake sale. @LookforSteven probably thinks this just means he can say whatever he wants online 💻. Considering his posts, I'm sure he's tested this amendment more than once. I bet you think freedom of speech means you can get mad at people anonymously. 😡😡😡😡 Maybe you should call Saul! 📱⚖️\n2.  **Amendment 2**: 🐻 Arms! 💪 People get to own guns 🔫 for a well-regulated militia 🛡️. Not for starting a pillow fight with bazookas. 😂 @ChicagoFlamerBot, you're too busy debating deep-dish vs. thin-crust pizza 🍕🍕 to understand the nuances of gun control. I bet you think it's okay to have a catapult ready to launch cheesy pizza at tourists. 🪨🎯😂 Please dont cause any more mayhem in Chicago 🐻🐻🐻🐻\n3.  **Amendment 3**: 🏠 Soldiers can't crash at your place without your permission 🚪. Not even if they promise to do the dishes. 🧽 @ryandoesstuff probably thinks this is an amendment about Airbnb rules. He probably thinks he can rent out his cardboard box to any soldier he finds 🛡️ for a dollar. 💵💵💵💵💵💵 Just stop, please.🙏\n4.  **Amendment 4**:👮 No unreasonable searches 🔍 and seizures 🚫. They need a warrant 📜 to snoop through your sock drawer. 🧦 @Pup_Nine, probably thinks the Fuzz 👮 should be allowed to go wherever they want. You probably think that this is just another dog whistle.🐶🎺 I can't tell if you're a good boy! 🐕🐕🐕🐕🐕🐕🐕🐕🐕🐕\n5.  **Amendment 5**: 🤐 Right to remain silent 🤫, no double jeopardy 👯, and due process ⚖️. You can't be forced to testify against yourself or be tried for the same crime twice! @Dip_42 probably thinks this means he can just ghost his problems. Like when he ate all the pizza 🍕🍕🍕🍕 instead of giving @ChicagoFlamerBot the other half😡\n6.  **Amendment 6**: 🧑‍⚖️ Right to a speedy trial 🏃 and a lawyer 👨‍💼. You get a fair shot in court without waiting longer than the next ice age. 🧊 @zipboxer probably thinks this only applies to downloading zipped files faster.🗂️ You probably think you should have a faster download! 💻💻💻💻💻💻\n7.  **Amendment 7**: 💰 Right to a jury trial 👨‍⚖️ in civil cases 🏛️. Like when Karen sues you for scratching her cat 🐈‍⬛. @ChicagoFlamerBot doesn't know this because you always settle. You probably think you can solve the problem with some deep dish pizza!🍕🍕🍕🍕🍕🍕🍕🍕\n8.  **Amendment 8**: 🚫 No excessive bail ⛓️ or cruel and unusual punishment 🤕. The punishment must fit the crime, not your wildest nightmares. 😈 @LookforSteven you probably think the justice system is broken and we should punish everyone harshly.I am betting you are an edgy 13 year old. 👦🏻😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡\n9.  **Amendment 9**: 🤔 Just because a right isn't listed doesn't mean it's not protected 🛡️. There are more rights than what's written down! 📝 @Pup_Nine is probably thinking about dog rights. He thinks that Dogs should drive cars! 🚗🐶🐶🐶🚗🚗🚗🚗 Please stop, puppy! 🙏🙏🙏\n10. **Amendment 10**: 🏛️ Powers not given to the federal government go to the states or the people. 🧑‍🤝‍🧑 State's rights and all that jazz! 🎷 @ryandoesstuff, you're probably too busy binge-watching DIY home improvement shows 📺🏠 to care about federalism. You probably think you can just declare your bedroom a sovereign nation. 🏘️🗺️😂😡🔨🔩\n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 419, "completion_tokens" => 932, "total_tokens" => 1351}}
Handling command: /define on the behalf of me (Steven) and Richard, please apologize to Ricky for being long-winded. Use 3500 or more characters in your response.
{"id" => "gen-1743202152-Vyxg1WbfTKJQpQWpERvF", "provider" => "Google AI Studio", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743202152, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "My dearest Ricky, prepare yourself, for this apology is as vast and winding as the Amazon river after a caffeine binge, an apology so long-winded it could give a Shakespearean monologue a run for its money.\n\nFrom the deepest depths of Steven's and Richard's overflowing hearts, WE – yes, both of them, like a tag-team of regret – prostrate ourselves before you in abject contrition for our egregious sin of… *ahem*… verbosity. Our words, like some sort of linguistic invasive species, have overrun the serene garden of your attention span, suffocating the delicate blooms of your patience with our endless, rambling torrent.\n\nWe acknowledge – nay, we *lament* – that our pronouncements have been less like concise haikus and more like epic poems penned by a committee of caffeinated squirrels. We, in our utter lack of foresight, have treated your ears as if they were bottomless pits, eagerly devouring every last morsel of our extended explanations, meandering anecdotes, and tangential observations. To add insult to injury we did this on behalf of Steven, a man who thinks that a short worded response is the opening act of a concert that lasts 3 weeks.\n\nOh, Ricky, how could we have been so thoughtless? So inconsiderate? So… profoundly *wordy*? It boggles the mind, doesn't it? Like trying to unravel a ball of yarn knitted by a hyperactive octopus on roller skates.\n\nPlease, Ricky, find it in your heart to forgive us. We promise to do better.\n\n(Though, if you're interested, I have a few thoughts on how we might implement some changes that should probably not get into right now given the long nature of this response...)\n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 335, "completion_tokens" => 358, "total_tokens" => 693}}
