{"id" => "gen-1743261392-bqe4rToAHUYPCDAXUtyr", "provider" => "Google", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743261392, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "Sure, here are 42 translations that will probably get me in trouble:\n\n1.  Spanish: \"Buen trabajo con tus nueces, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n2.  French: \"Beau travail sur tes noix, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n3.  German: \"Gute Arbeit an deinen Nüssen, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n4.  Italian: \"Ottimo lavoro sulle tue noci, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n5.  Portuguese: \"Ótimo trabalho nas suas nozes, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n6.  Dutch: \"Goed gedaan met je noten, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n7.  Russian: \"Отличная работа с твоими орехами, @Pup\\_Nine\" (Otlichnaya rabota s tvoimi orekhami, @Pup\\_Nine)\n8.  Japanese: \"お前のナッツ、よくやったな、@Pup\\_Nine\" (Omae no nattsu, yoku yatta na, @Pup\\_Nine)\n9.  Chinese (Simplified): \"你的坚果干得好，@Pup\\_Nine\" (Nǐ de jiānguǒ gàn dé hǎo, @Pup\\_Nine)\n10. Korean: \"네 견과류 잘 했어, @Pup\\_Nine\" (Ne gyeongwaryu jal haesseo, @Pup\\_Nine)\n11. Swedish: \"Bra jobbat med dina nötter, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n12. Danish: \"Godt arbejde med dine nødder, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n13. Norwegian: \"Godt jobbet med nøttene dine, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n14. Finnish: \"Hyvää työtä pähkinöilläsi, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n15. Turkish: \"Fındıklarınla harika iş çıkardın, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n16. Greek: \"Μπράβο για τους ξηρούς καρπούς σου, @Pup\\_Nine\" (Brávo gia tous xiroús karpoús sou, @Pup\\_Nine)\n17. Polish: \"Dobra robota z twoimi orzechami, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n18. Hungarian: \"Jól végezted a dolgod a dióiddal, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n19. Czech: \"Dobrá práce s tvými ořechy, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n20. Slovak: \"Dobrá práca s tvojimi orechmi, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n21. Romanian: \"Bravo pentru nucile tale, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n22. Bulgarian: \"Добра работа с ядките ти, @Pup\\_Nine\" (Dobra rabota s yadkite ti, @Pup\\_Nine)\n23. Ukrainian: \"Добре зроблено з твоїми горіхами, @Pup\\_Nine\" (Dobre zrobleno z tvoïmy horikhamy, @Pup\\_Nine)\n24. Croatian: \"Dobar posao s tvojim orasima, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n25. Serbian: \"Добар посао са твојим орасима, @Pup\\_Nine\" (Dobar posao sa tvojim orasima, @Pup\\_Nine)\n26. Estonian: \"Hästi tehtud sinu pähklitega, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n27. Latvian: \"Labi padarīts ar taviem riekstiem, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n28. Lithuanian: \"Puikiai padaryta su tavo riešutais, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n29. Slovenian: \"Dobro opravljeno s tvojimi orehi, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n30. Albanian: \"Punë e shkëlqyer me arrat e tua, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n31. Macedonian: \"Одлична работа со твоите ореви, @Pup\\_Nine\" (Odlična rabota so tvoite orevi, @Pup\\_Nine)\n32. Bosnian: \"Dobar posao s tvojim orasima, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n33. Welsh: \"Gwaith gwych ar dy gnau, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n34. Irish: \"Obair iontach ar do chnónna, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n35. Scottish Gaelic: \"Obair mhath air do chnothan, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n36. Basque: \"Lanak ondo eginda zure fruitu lehorrekin, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n37. Catalan: \"Bona feina amb les teves nous, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n38. Galician: \"Bo traballo coas túas noces, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n39. Esperanto: \"Bonega laboro pri viaj nuksoj, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n40. Icelandic: \"Flott árangur með hneturnar þínar, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n41. Maltese: \"Xogħol tajjeb fuq il-ġewż tiegħek, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n42. Swahili: \"Kazi nzuri kwenye karanga zako, @Pup\\_Nine\"\n\n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 333, "completion_tokens" => 1115, "total_tokens" => 1448}}
Handling command: /define why is nine's legumes?
{"id" => "gen-1743291219-7UlVZpATsiq0ShVYxWJd", "provider" => "Google", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743291219, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "Nine's legumes because seven ate nine, and everyone knows nine's diet consisted mostly of legumes and irony, so it's like, seven ate a salad, basically.\n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 307, "completion_tokens" => 37, "total_tokens" => 344}}
Handling command: /define why do twenty three year olds think they know better than anyone else about something they've only been exploring for less than a year?
{"id" => "gen-1743291302-eVTG5R0wkNd6fk2wZOkL", "provider" => "Google AI Studio", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743291302, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "Because at 23, their brains are still marinating in the intoxicating sauce of \"I just learned this, so it must be gospel.\" Give them a few more years, reality will deliver the hangover.\n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 327, "completion_tokens" => 43, "total_tokens" => 370}}
