{"id" => "gen-1743296387-iSTfEKi71kwr02y3qgat", "provider" => "Google", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743296387, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "Clearly, the word you're looking for is \"Orange.\" It rhymes with \"door hinge,\" \"gorange,\" and \"I'm not telling you, find them yourself.\"\n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 313, "completion_tokens" => 38, "total_tokens" => 351}}
Handling command: /define what does the following emotion mean? Brass
{"id" => "gen-1743296405-wrv3gHcAd5dnWs0rXF2z", "provider" => "Google", "model" => "google/gemini-2.0-flash-001", "object" => "chat.completion", "created" => 1743296405, "choices" => [{"logprobs" => nil, "finish_reason" => "stop", "native_finish_reason" => "STOP", "index" => 0, "message" => {"role" => "assistant", "content" => "Brass is that feeling you get when you're about to parallel park in front of a crowd, knowing full well you only passed your driving test because the instructor felt sorry for you.\n", "refusal" => nil}}], "usage" => {"prompt_tokens" => 308, "completion_tokens" => 38, "total_tokens" => 346}}